graphersal-server is a server for Graphersal (https://github.com/graphersal/graphersal) graph
databases, built on Graphersal's crates, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Graphersal is compatible with, and inspired by, the Apache TinkerPop graph computing framework
and its Gremlin traversal language. Neither Graphersal nor graphersal-server is part of Apache
TinkerPop or affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by the Apache Software Foundation.
